        "content": {
          "type": "text",
          "text": " <!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n  <title>北站修补所｜鞋履与钥匙档案</title>\n  <style>\n    @import url('https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Jost:wght@400;500;600;700&family=Literata:wght@400;500;600&family=Noto+Sans+SC:wght@400;500;600;700&family=Noto+Serif+SC:wght@400;500;600&display=swap');\n\n    :root {\n      --paper: #2C3034;\n      --ink: #EBEEF0;\n      --ink-mid: #C2C8CD;\n      --ink-soft: #A8AFB5;\n      --rule: #6E767C;\n      --paper-lift: #33383D;\n    }\n\n    * {\n      box-sizing: border-box;\n    }\n\n    html {\n      background: var(--paper);\n    }\n\n    body {\n      margin: 0;\n      background: var(--paper);\n      color: var(--ink);\n      font-family: \"Noto Serif SC\", \"Literata\", \"Georgia\", serif;\n      font-size: 17px;\n      line-height: 1.55;\n    }\n\n    a {\n      color: inherit;\n    }\n\n    .page {\n      min-height: 100vh;\n      padding: 30px 5.5vw 24px;\n      overflow: hidden;\n    }\n\n    .masthead {\n      display: grid;\n      grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) 220px;\n      gap: 30px;\n      align-items: start;\n      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--rule);\n      padding-bottom: 20px;\n    }\n\n    .eyebrow {\n      margin: 0 0 7px;\n      color: var(--ink-soft);\n      font-family: \"Jost\", \"Noto Sans SC\", sans-serif;\n      font-size: 12px;\n      letter-spacing: .16em;\n      text-transform: uppercase;\n    }\n\n    h1 {\n      max-width: 920px;\n      margin: 0;\n      color: var(--ink);\n      font-family: \"Jost\", \"Noto Sans SC\", sans-serif;\n      font-size: clamp(58px, 8.2vw, 108px);\n      font-weight: 500;\n      letter-spacing: -.055em;\n      line-height: .92;\n    }\n\n    .masthead-note {\n      margin: 7px 0 0;\n      color: var(--ink-mid);\n      font-size: 15px;\n      line-height: 1.7;\n    }\n\n    .contact {\n      display: flex;\n      flex-direction: column;\n      gap: 8px;\n      align-items: flex-start;\n      padding-top: 3px;\n    }\n\n    .contact-label {\n      color: var(--ink-soft);\n      font-family: \"Jost\", \"Noto Sans SC\", sans-serif;\n      font-size: 12px;\n      letter-spacing: .12em;\n    }\n\n    .contact a {\n      display: inline-block;\n      background: var(--ink);\n      color: var(--paper);\n      padding: 9px 13px 10px;\n      font-family: \"Jost\", \"Noto Sans SC\", sans-serif;\n      font-size: 15px;\n      font-weight: 600;\n      letter-spacing: .04em;\n      text-decoration: none;\n      white-space: nowrap;\n    }\n\n    .contact small {\n      color: var(--ink-soft);\n      font-size: 13px;\n    }\n\n    .index {\n      display: grid;\n      grid-template-columns: 1.12fr .88fr 1.28fr .9fr 1.16fr;\n      gap: 12px 24px;\n      align-items: start;\n      padding: 22px 0 18px;\n    }\n\n    .entry {\n      position: relative;\n      min-height: 166px;\n      border-top: 1px solid var(--rule);\n      padding: 12px 15px 15px 0;\n      background: var(--paper);\n    }\n\n    .entry:nth-child(1) {\n      grid-column: 1 / span 2;\n      min-height: 188px;\n      margin-left: 0;\n    }\n\n    .entry:nth-child(2) {\n      grid-column: 4 / span 2;\n      min-height: 145px;\n      margin-left: 3%;\n    }\n\n    .entry:nth-child(3) {\n      grid-column: 2 / span 2;\n      min-height: 178px;\n      margin-left: 5.5%;\n    }\n\n    .entry:nth-child(4) {\n      grid-column: 5;\n      min-height: 155px;\n      margin-left: 2%;\n    }\n\n    .entry:nth-child(5) {\n      grid-column: 1 / span 2;\n      min-height: 151px;\n      margin-left: 7%;\n    }\n\n    .entry:nth-child(6) {\n      grid-column: 3 / span 2;\n      min-height: 171px;\n      margin-left: 4%;\n    }\n\n    .entry:nth-child(7) {\n      grid-column: 4 / span 2;\n      min-height: 146px;\n      margin-left: 1%;\n      margin-right: 12px;\n    }\n\n    .entry::before {\n      content: \"\";\n      position: absolute;\n      top: -1px;\n      left: 0;\n      width: 30px;\n      border-top: 1px solid var(--ink-mid);\n    }\n\n    .entry-meta {\n      display: flex;\n      align-items: baseline;\n      justify-content: space-between;\n      gap: 12px;\n      margin-bottom: 12px;\n      color: var(--ink-soft);\n      font-family: \"Jost\", \"Noto Sans SC\", sans-serif;\n      font-size: 12px;\n      letter-spacing: .08em;\n    }\n\n    .entry h2 {\n      margin: 0 0 8px;\n      color: var(--ink);\n      font-family: \"Jost\", \"Noto Sans SC\", sans-serif;\n      font-size: 25px;\n      font-weight: 500;\n      letter-spacing: -.025em;\n      line-height: 1.15;\n    }\n\n    .entry p {\n      margin: 0;\n      color: var(--ink-mid);\n      font-size: 15px;\n      line-height: 1.72;\n    }\n\n    .entry-note {\n      display: block;\n      margin-top: 13px;\n      color: var(--ink-soft);\n      font-family: \"Jost\", \"Noto Sans SC\", sans-serif;\n      font-size: 12px;\n      letter-spacing: .04em;\n    }\n\n    .footer {\n      display: flex;\n      justify-content: space-between;\n      gap: 20px;\n      border-top: 1px solid var(--rule);\n      padding-top: 13px;\n      color: var(--ink-soft);\n      font-family: \"Jost\", \"Noto Sans SC\", sans-serif;\n      font-size: 12px;\n      letter-spacing: .04em;\n    }\n\n    .footer strong {\n      color: var(--ink-mid);\n      font-weight: 500;\n    }\n\n    @media (max-width: 820px) {\n      .page {\n        padding: 24px 6vw 20px;\n      }\n\n      .masthead {\n        grid-template-columns: 1fr;\n        gap: 18px;\n      }\n\n      .contact {\n        flex-direction: row;\n        align-items: center;\n        flex-wrap: wrap;\n      }\n\n      .index {\n        display: flex;\n        flex-direction: column;\n        gap: 0;\n        padding-top: 15px;\n      }\n\n      .entry,\n      .entry:nth-child(1),\n      .entry:nth-child(2),\n      .entry:nth-child(3),\n      .entry:nth-child(4),\n      .entry:nth-child(5),\n      .entry:nth-child(6),\n      .entry:nth-child(7) {\n        width: 100%;\n        min-height: 0;\n        margin: 0;\n        padding: 17px 0 19px;\n      }\n\n      .entry:nth-child(2),\n      .entry:nth-child(4),\n      .entry:nth-child(7) {\n        padding-left: 3%;\n      }\n\n      .footer {\n        align-items: flex-start;\n        flex-direction: column;\n        gap: 5px;\n      }\n    }\n\n    @media (max-width: 430px) {\n      h1 {\n        font-size: 56px;\n      }\n\n      .entry h2 {\n        font-size: 23px;\n      }\n    }\n  </style>\n</head>\n<body>\n  <main class=\"page\">\n    <header class=\"masthead\">\n      <div>\n        <p class=\"eyebrow\">North Station / Repair Index / 2024—</p>\n        <h1>修补所<br>登记簿</h1>\n        <p class=\"masthead-note\">鞋履修复与钥匙制作。小规模接件，按约定时间办理。</p>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"contact\">\n        <span class=\"contact-label\">预约登记 / CALL</span>\n        <a href=\"tel:13800138000\">138 0013 8000</a>\n        <small>请先电话说明项目与预计到店时间</small>\n      </div>\n    </header>\n\n    <section class=\"index\" aria-label=\"服务索引\">\n      <article class=\"entry\">\n        <div class=\"entry-meta\"><span>01 / SERVICE</span><span>鞋履</span></div>\n        <h2>鞋底与跟部修复</h2>\n        <p>处理开胶、磨损、断跟及局部塌陷。先检查受力位置，再决定补强、粘合或更换，不以外观覆盖结构问题。</p>\n        <span class=\"entry-note\">常规项目：当日可评估</span>\n      </article>\n\n      <article class=\"entry\">\n        <div class=\"entry-meta\"><span>02 / SERVICE</span><span>钥匙</span></div>\n        <h2>日常钥匙配制</h2>\n        <p>住宅门钥匙、信箱钥匙与常见挂锁钥匙均可办理。请携带原钥匙；无原件时，需先电话确认条件。</p>\n        <span class=\"entry-note\">以原件清晰度为准</span>\n      </article>\n\n      <article class=\"entry\">\n        <div class=\"entry-meta\"><span>03 / METHOD</span><span>判断</span></div>\n        <h2>先判定，再施工</h2>\n        <p>每件物品先记录材质、损耗与使用频率。无法稳定修复的情况会直接说明，不以短期粘合冒充完整修复。</p>\n        <span class=\"entry-note\">记录决定工序</span>\n      </article>\n\n      <article class=\"entry\">\n        <div class=\"entry-meta\"><span>04 / ACCESS</span><span>到店</span></div>\n        <h2>预约优先</h2>\n        <p>工作台空间有限，接件采用电话预约。临时到店可以询问，但不能保证当时有空档。</p>\n        <span class=\"entry-note\">周一至周六 / 09:30—18:30</span>\n      </article>\n\n      <article class=\"entry\">\n        <div class=\"entry-meta\"><span>05 / SCOPE</span><span>边界</span></div>\n        <h2>不承接的部分</h2>\n        <p>不处理无法确认来源的钥匙复制，不承诺改变锁具权限；贵重皮具与特殊材质请先提供情况说明。</p>\n        <span class=\"entry-note\">先确认，再收件</span>\n      </article>\n\n      <article class=\"entry\">\n        <div class=\"entry-meta\"><span>06 / LOCATION</span><span>档案位置</span></div>\n        <h2>北站街 17 号</h2>\n        <p>店面位于北站南侧旧街，靠近公交站牌。到店后请从临街窗口说明预约姓名，物品将按登记号接收。</p>\n        <span class=\"entry-note\">登记号随取件凭条保留</span>\n      </article>\n\n      <article class=\"entry\">\n        <div class=\"entry-meta\"><span>07 / NEXT ISSUE</span><span>下一期</span></div>\n        <h2>什么时候再来</h2>\n        <p>取件时间以电话确认结果为准。若修复过程中发现新的结构问题，我们会在继续之前重新联系。</p>\n        <span class=\"entry-note\">保留凭条，按约取件</span>\n      </article>\n    </section>\n\n    <footer class=\"footer\">\n      <span><strong>索引范围：</strong>01—07 / 鞋履、钥匙、接件与取件</span>\n      <span><strong>本页版本：</strong>NSR—07 / 2024.06</span>\n    </footer>\n  </main>\n</body>\n</html>"
        }
      }
    }
